1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,510
The blast furnace.

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:06,901
Roasted ore, coke and limestone go in at the top, roughly eight to four to one.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:11,471
A blast of hot air enters near the bottom through the tuyeres.

4
00:00:11,471 --> 00:00:16,236
The charge sinks slowly through four zones, hottest at the bottom.

